576
00:53:21,161 --> 00:53:21,995
I didn't.

577
00:53:22,561 --> 00:53:23,495
I've already exchanged it.

578
00:53:38,395 --> 00:53:39,802
I invited him along.

579
00:53:39,802 --> 00:53:41,761
He's at the same tutoring place with Book.

580
00:53:45,961 --> 00:53:47,895
