581
00:53:48,228 --> 00:53:49,228
You must score some goals.

582
00:53:50,695 --> 00:53:51,625
That's easy.

583
00:53:51,625 --> 00:53:52,295
Go ahead, dude.

584
00:53:57,428 --> 00:53:58,561
Nice strike.

585
00:54:02,828 --> 00:54:04,061
Why don't you play it, Frame?

586
00:54:15,228 --> 00:54:17,861
