587
00:54:18,795 --> 00:54:19,595
How much is it?

588
00:54:20,661 --> 00:54:21,461
It's fine.

589
00:54:24,661 --> 00:54:27,028
Well, I'll treat you some snacks later.

590
00:54:28,095 --> 00:54:28,895
Great.

591
00:54:29,295 --> 00:54:30,095
Wanna play?

592
00:54:31,061 --> 00:54:31,861
Of course.

593
00:54:32,061 --> 00:54:33,428
Do you know how to play? I"ll teach you.

594
00:54:33,661 --> 00:54:35,228
I don't know, teach me.

595
00:54:36,061 --> 00:54:37,095
This couple too?

596
00:54:39,295 --> 00:54:40,095
I have no idea.

597
00:54:41,095 --> 00:54:42,561
Aren't you close to Tee?

598
00:54:43,395 --> 00:54:44,261
I really have no idea.

599
00:55:14,595 --> 00:55:15,264
Fuse.

600
00:55:15,264 --> 00:55:16,961
Frame.

601
00:55:17,695 --> 00:55:18,961
Let him sleep.

602
00:55:19,428 --> 00:55:21,661
He told me he didn't get any sleep last night.

603
00:55:23,628 --> 00:55:24,995
(Frame) Shall we leave now?

604
00:55:26,795 --> 00:55:27,595
(Book) It's up to you.

605
00:55:30,496 --> 00:55:31,395
(Frame) What should I do?

606
00:55:32,361 --> 00:55:33,295
(Frame) Do you want to go back now?

607
00:55:34,861 --> 00:55:37,395
(Book) You decide. I'm fine with going back.

608
00:55:41,895 --> 00:55:44,795
Hey, I'm leaving. I have to take Book home.

609
00:55:44,995 --> 00:55:46,961
I'll go with you. My mom told me to go home.

610
00:55:47,195 --> 00:55:48,561
Me too. Let's go.

611
00:55:48,795 --> 00:55:50,461
-Okay, you guys can leave.
-See you.

612
00:55:50,461 --> 00:55:51,395
I'll look after Fuse.

613
00:55:52,784 --> 00:55:53,550
-Bye.
-See you.

614
00:55:53,550 --> 00:55:54,799
See you.

615
00:55:55,765 --> 00:55:56,265
Let's go.

616
00:55:56,530 --> 00:55:57,445
Come on.

617
00:55:57,445 --> 00:55:58,265
Which way? Turn right?

618
00:56:01,295 --> 00:56:03,795
Lookmo, can I talk to you for a minute?

619
00:56:08,861 --> 00:56:13,828
Tee, can you look after him for me?
I'll be back soon.

620
00:57:14,561 --> 00:57:15,395
What's your problem?

621
00:57:15,661 --> 00:57:16,961
Why are you making that face?

622
00:57:21,028 --> 00:57:22,397
What are you mad at?

623
00:57:22,397 --> 00:57:25,095
I should be the one who is mad
since you didn't come yesterday.

624
00:57:25,861 --> 00:57:28,561
Why are you mad?
You already had company.

625
00:57:28,761 --> 00:57:31,961
Since you didn't come,
so I brought a friend to dance instead.

626
00:57:34,061 --> 00:57:35,061
Are you sure he's just friends?

627
00:57:37,695 --> 00:57:38,495
Kris.

628
00:57:38,695 --> 00:57:39,495
Kris.

629
00:57:40,628 --> 00:57:42,195
That's a badass name.

630
00:57:51,161 --> 00:57:53,395
That is my friend, Kristina.

631
00:57:54,595 --> 00:57:56,261
Hi, darling.

632
00:57:58,461 --> 00:57:59,961
Are you over it yet?

633
00:58:00,961 --> 00:58:02,228
I also wanted to dance with you...

634
00:58:02,495 --> 00:58:03,595
but you couldn't come.

635
00:58:05,661 --> 00:58:06,561
That's all I want to say.

636
00:58:06,895 --> 00:58:07,489
I'm off.

637
00:58:07,489 --> 00:58:08,161
Hold on.

638
00:58:11,761 --> 00:58:12,828
Wanna grab some food?

639
00:58:13,361 --> 00:58:14,695
My treat. Let me make it up to you.

640
00:58:16,695 --> 00:58:17,495
And...

641
00:58:18,828 --> 00:58:20,428
I want to have dinner with you as well.

642
00:58:32,995 --> 00:58:35,304
Hello? Lookmo?

643
00:58:35,898 --> 00:58:39,575
He's still sleeping.
You want me to take him home?

644
00:58:41,761 --> 00:58:42,561
What about you?

645
00:58:43,828 --> 00:58:44,628
Ah.

646
00:58:46,228 --> 00:58:47,561
I'll take him home instead.

647
00:58:49,028 --> 00:58:49,828
Okay.

648
00:58:54,561 --> 00:58:56,461
Lookmo told me to take Fuse home.

649
00:58:59,228 --> 00:59:01,828
So we have to wait until he wakes up then.

650
00:59:04,895 --> 00:59:08,061
If I fell asleep like Fuse, would you look after me?

651
00:59:08,661 --> 00:59:10,461
Of course, we're friends.

652
00:59:13,895 --> 00:59:16,195
So, am I just a freind to you?

653
00:59:20,795 --> 00:59:22,495
Is there still any hope for me?

654
00:59:35,859 --> 00:59:36,518
Sys.

655
00:59:41,695 --> 00:59:42,861
Don't put your hope in me.

656
00:59:47,861 --> 00:59:49,395
It's not that you're not good,

657
00:59:50,761 --> 00:59:52,461
but I'm just not ready to be with anyone.

658
00:59:53,495 --> 00:59:54,295
I'm sorry.

659
00:59:58,961 --> 01:00:00,028
Are you not ready?

660
01:00:00,395 --> 01:00:02,795
Or do you already have someone in your mind?

661
01:00:14,261 --> 01:00:18,061
Even though he keeps hurting you,
you still don't think about walking away?

662
01:00:22,761 --> 01:00:25,095
Love is nonsense.

663
01:00:25,795 --> 01:00:26,995
I'd better go.

664
01:00:27,895 --> 01:00:28,761
Get home safely.

665
01:00:36,961 --> 01:00:37,761
Oh!

666
01:00:58,995 --> 01:01:00,461
Aren't you dating with Sys?

667
01:01:04,334 --> 01:01:05,315
He's a friend.

668
01:01:15,061 --> 01:01:17,661
I thought you like him at first.

669
01:01:20,495 --> 01:01:21,961
Don't say like that.

670
01:01:25,161 --> 01:01:27,161
As if you don't know who I like.

671
01:01:35,395 --> 01:01:37,295
You told me to get over you.

672
01:01:38,195 --> 01:01:39,595
But it's not that easy.

673
01:01:42,361 --> 01:01:43,395
Because I'm not you.

674
01:01:47,895 --> 01:01:53,099
If you still can't get over me,…

675
01:01:55,023 --> 01:01:57,023
(Fuse) Can we…
(Tee) How's Jeen doing?

676
01:02:01,261 --> 01:02:03,457
About Jeen...

677
01:02:06,425 --> 01:02:07,444
Never mind.

678
01:02:08,577 --> 01:02:09,595
I don't want to know it anymore.

679
01:02:13,247 --> 01:02:16,295
About what we talked, I'm going to make it.

680
01:02:18,695 --> 01:02:19,895
I told you.

681
01:02:21,461 --> 01:02:22,795
I can do everything for you.

682
01:02:25,761 --> 01:02:28,195
Tee, hear me out.

683
01:02:30,496 --> 01:02:31,101
I mean...

684
01:02:34,261 --> 01:02:36,861
Let's go. I'll take you home.

685
01:02:55,995 --> 01:02:58,195
X, O, X.

686
01:03:04,495 --> 01:03:05,995
You have to hand in it to teacher.

687
01:03:06,495 --> 01:03:07,295
Really?

688
01:03:07,295 --> 01:03:07,795
Yeah.

689
01:03:07,795 --> 01:03:08,995
It's okay. It's just a back cover.

690
01:03:10,428 --> 01:03:12,428
Hello, class rep.

691
01:03:13,361 --> 01:03:16,028
Do you really have to
bow to him every morning and afternoon?

692
01:03:16,261 --> 01:03:17,461
Well, I respect him.

693
01:03:19,261 --> 01:03:22,361
If you don't have a love life, just hang in there.

694
01:03:22,828 --> 01:03:25,461
Why did you say it harshly?

695
01:03:25,761 --> 01:03:26,828
Move over a bit.

696
01:03:31,595 --> 01:03:32,395
Ugh.

697
01:03:32,795 --> 01:03:34,628
When will I can start studying?

698
01:03:35,195 --> 01:03:36,361
Alright.

699
01:03:37,428 --> 01:03:38,828
Look at this.

700
01:03:39,495 --> 01:03:42,895
The answer of this question is in this paragraph.

701
01:03:45,095 --> 01:03:47,761
But the answer of my heart is here.

702
01:03:52,295 --> 01:03:54,195
I'm sick of this smell. Go away.

703
01:03:54,195 --> 01:03:54,995
This smell?

704
01:03:55,456 --> 01:03:56,149
Wit, you good?

705
01:03:56,150 --> 01:03:57,437
Smell of love.

706
01:03:57,437 --> 01:03:58,028
Is there anything smelly?

707
01:03:58,195 --> 01:03:59,166
Did you say those words?

708
01:03:59,166 --> 01:03:59,995
Yeah.

709
01:04:00,361 --> 01:04:01,195
So cringe.

710
01:04:02,428 --> 01:04:03,461
Did I say something wrong?

711
01:04:04,495 --> 01:04:05,295
Nothing is wrong.

712
01:04:10,261 --> 01:04:11,195
Hello?

713
01:04:11,995 --> 01:04:13,028
I'm at school now.

714
01:04:13,661 --> 01:04:14,761
Did you bring your shirt?

715
01:04:16,161 --> 01:04:17,261
Shall we go dance this afternoon?

716
01:04:18,995 --> 01:04:19,761
Hello.

717
01:04:19,761 --> 01:04:20,661
Hey, I'm still talking.

718
01:04:21,395 --> 01:04:22,529
Yes, baby.

719
01:04:22,529 --> 01:04:23,029
Est.

720
01:04:24,295 --> 01:04:25,268
Hey.

721
01:04:26,347 --> 01:04:26,933
Hey.

722
01:04:26,933 --> 01:04:28,212
Give it to me.

723
01:04:28,212 --> 01:04:29,630
What's going on?

724
01:04:31,896 --> 01:04:33,160
Hello?

725
01:04:34,077 --> 01:04:37,195
See you this afternoon. Bye.

726
01:04:43,795 --> 01:04:44,617
Oh.

727
01:04:44,617 --> 01:04:45,117
Tee.

728
01:04:46,124 --> 01:04:47,390
Champ and Copter.

729
01:05:41,761 --> 01:05:43,161
How are you doing?

730
01:05:43,761 --> 01:05:47,428
I told you I'm not you because I love you.

731
01:05:47,995 --> 01:05:49,126
Between Tee and you,

732
01:05:49,126 --> 01:05:51,381
